00:010:04.000 --> 00:010:08.000
You know, these things are unheard of. How can you take it back?

00:010:08.000 --> 00:010:12.000
I mean, not only have they said how did he get the Ph.D.?

00:010:12.000 --> 00:010:17.000
How did he get the Ph.D. with this high degree, high honors, the highest honors?

00:010:17.000 --> 00:010:19.000
They call it the first honors

00:010:19.000 --> 00:010:22.000
مرتبة الشرف الأولى in Arabic

00:010:22.000 --> 00:010:25.000
The rank of the highest honor.

00:010:25.000 --> 00:010:30.000
And it had all these things and they cut it down, by the way, you know but...

00:010:30.000 --> 00:010:36.000
After cutting out whatever they wanted, they still, they still don't like it in the newspaper.

00:010:36.000 --> 00:010:47.000
So, this shows you the power of God and shows how God nullifies the excuses of the people in order to effect the test.

00:010:47.000 --> 00:010:57.000
For those who don't like the sun rising at 4 o'clock, God will make it rise at 7, gradually.

00:010:57.000 --> 00:011:00.000
And for those who don't like fasting for 16 hours in a day,

00:011:00.000 --> 00:011:04.000
God will make it 9 hours in a cool day.

00:011:04.000 --> 00:011:08.000
Tooboo Ela Allah. Repent.

00:011:18.000 --> 00:011:23.000
Alhamdu Lillah, Wa Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah.

00:011:26.000 --> 00:011:33.000
I know many of you are anxious to hear our report on our Canada trip.

00:011:33.000 --> 00:011:40.000
One of the purposes of the KHUTBA on Friday is to study our affairs and see what is going on.

00:011:40.000 --> 00:011:46.000
And Dr. Mansour and myself went to Canada on the weekend

00:011:46.000 --> 00:011:51.000
and there were a number of miracles that happened.

00:011:51.000 --> 00:012:00.000
First of all, somehow, I forgot that an Egyptian going to Canada needs a visa, an entry visa

00:012:00.000 --> 00:012:10.000
and what is worse, an Egyptian who applies for a visa in any Canadian consulate,

00:012:10.000 --> 00:012:11.000
they have one in Seattle,

00:012:11.000 --> 00:012:14.000
there is a five day mandatory

00:012:14.000 --> 00:012:17.000
mandatory five-day waiting period

00:012:17.000 --> 00:012:22.000
because they telex Cairo and ask if this person is a terrorist or what.

00:012:22.000 --> 00:012:29.000
And, as far as Egypt is concerned, he is the biggest terrorist in all Egypt, one could say

00:012:29.000 --> 00:012:34.000
and his being here is actually a miracle because he is forbidden from travel.

00:012:34.000 --> 00:012:38.000
There were people in the prison who were there for years

00:012:38.000 --> 00:012:45.000
for religious reasons because they offended the person who was interviewing them or something.

00:012:45.000 --> 00:012:48.000
And this is something that he did the first day.

00:012:48.000 --> 00:012:51.000
On the first day, when they were interrogating him

00:012:51.000 --> 00:012:57.000
the officer, or the lawyer, whoever it is, the district attorney

00:012:57.000 --> 00:012:59.000
in the prison interviewing him and said

00:012:59.000 --> 00:013:02.000
I'm a Muslim, I don't pray

00:013:02.000 --> 00:013:04.000
and I don't fast, but I'm going to Heaven.

00:013:04.000 --> 00:013:05.000
Ain't I?

00:013:05.000 --> 00:013:07.000
He said no, you're going to Hell.

00:013:09.000 --> 00:013:10.000
He didn't mince words.

00:013:10.000 --> 00:013:13.000
And he is out here.

00:013:13.000 --> 00:013:18.000
There are stories of people who offended the interrogators inside and then never made it out.

00:013:18.000 --> 00:013:21.000
They're still there, for years.

00:013:21.000 --> 00:013:23.000
And we know them by name,

00:013:23.000 --> 00:013:25.000
but he is out here.

00:013:26.000 --> 00:013:30.000
We sent a few telegrams from around the world

00:013:30.000 --> 00:013:33.000
to the president's office in Egypt

00:013:33.000 --> 00:013:37.000
and we read Al-Fãtehah. This is a very powerful prayer, ALHAMDU LILLAH.

00:013:37.000 --> 00:013:44.000
So, for a variety of reasons, they let him out on his own recognizance with the stipulation that he's not to leave the country.

00:013:45.000 --> 00:013:49.000
And now he's haunting them because we're are sending the new (Muslim) Perspective,

00:013:49.000 --> 00:013:52.000
the title is Al-Azhar disbelieves in Quran.

00:013:52.000 --> 00:013:59.000
Now, they called him, they called him منکر السنة (rejector of Sunna) in Egypt or

00:013:59.000 --> 00:014:01.000
something we really admit, the rejector of Sunna.

00:014:01.000 --> 00:014:10.000
And you know, prisons affect a person's psych somehow and

00:014:10.000 --> 00:014:17.000
he happened to leave the prison on a miserable day. The weather, it was raining. There was mud.

00:014:17.000 --> 00:014:22.000
Cairo was not prepared. Especially, where, the area where he lives is not prepared for rain

00:014:22.000 --> 00:014:28.000
and there was a lot of mud there where you stepped in the mud and then you go, you leave your shoe in the mud.

00:014:31.000 --> 00:014:34.000
put in front of you, put your foot in it

00:014:34.000 --> 00:014:39.000
and then you leave your left shoe in the mud.

00:014:39.000 --> 00:014:44.000
So, he caught himself talking aloud to himself saying

00:014:44.000 --> 00:014:46.000
ok منکر السنة or rejector of Sunna,

00:014:46.000 --> 00:014:50.000
be careful, lest you slip down or something.

00:014:50.000 --> 00:014:54.000
So, he was out talking to himself with this title that they gave him منکر السنة (rejector of Sunna)

00:014:54.000 --> 00:015:00.000
Now, as of the next issue of the Perspective, we're gonna call the Azhar people: منکر القرآن

00:015:00.000 --> 00:015:05.000
The rejectors of Quran.

00:015:07.000 --> 00:015:12.000
And we are going to issue emergency issues of the Perspective every other week

00:015:12.000 --> 00:015:14.000
and we're mailing them to them over there.

00:015:14.000 --> 00:015:22.000
We're proud of our title rejectors of Sunna and we'll see how proud they are with their title as rejectors of Quran.

00:015:22.000 --> 00:015:25.000
Something that is supported by evidence

00:015:25.000 --> 00:015:26.000
for example

00:015:26.000 --> 00:015:30.000
an editorial, the official Azhar journal

00:015:30.000 --> 00:015:33.000
wrote an editorial in January, the last issue

00:015:33.000 --> 00:015:34.000
attacking him

00:015:34.000 --> 00:015:40.000
and in that, they said that the Quran needs to be detailed.

00:015:40.000 --> 00:015:45.000
I mean, there are about ten statements directly against Quran.

00:015:45.000 --> 00:015:47.000
So, we're taking this statement

00:015:47.000 --> 00:015:51.000
putting it, this is what the Azhar Ignoramuses say

00:015:51.000 --> 00:015:54.000
and this is what God says

00:015:54.000 --> 00:015:56.000
and we give the verses that say the Quran is fully detailed.

00:015:56.000 --> 00:015:59.000
And we're gonna do this for the rest of the year.

00:016:02.000 --> 00:016:03.000
Ok. We went to a ...

00:016:03.000 --> 00:016:09.000
So, this is, I just got diverted to the miracle of him leaving Cairo, leaving Egypt.

00:016:09.000 --> 00:016:11.000
It is an absolute miracle.

00:016:11.000 --> 00:016:16.000
As a matter of fact, an informer in his group found out that he was leaving

00:016:16.000 --> 00:016:27.000
but without a definite date and he did something that cancelled that informer's information.

00:016:27.000 --> 00:016:30.000
In any rate, we're glad that he's here.

